# Build output for both plugin variants - assembled fresh by each project's own build, then synced to
# Stream Deck's real Plugins folder. See audio-switcher-exe/ and audio-switcher-node/ for the sources.
# The exe's output folder is entirely generated (nothing there is hand-edited), so it's ignored whole;
# the Node one mixes generated content (bin/, AudioDevicesIcons/) with real source (manifest.json, ui/,
# LICENSE) that lives here permanently, so only the generated parts are ignored.
/com.morganscruggs.audioswitcherplus.sdPlugin/
/com.morgan-scruggs.audioswitcherplus-node.sdPlugin/bin/
/com.morgan-scruggs.audioswitcherplus-node.sdPlugin/AudioDevicesIcons/

